{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "Kling 4.0 图像生成任务 - 提交任务",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "通过 `/kling/image-generation` 提交 Kling 4.0 文生单图、图生单图、文生组图或图生组图任务。注意：平台暂时不对接主体（`element`）和音色（`voice`）相关能力，相关参数暂不支持传入。"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://baze-api.powerbuyin.top",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Kling",
      "description": "Kling 原生异步任务端点"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/kling/image-generation": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Kling 4.0 图像生成任务",
        "description": "通过 `/kling/image-generation` 提交 Kling 4.0 文生单图、图生单图、文生组图或图生组图任务。单图模式可生成多张独立图片，组图模式生成内容关联的一组图片。注意：平台暂时不对接主体（`element`）和音色（`voice`）相关能力，相关参数暂不支持传入。",
        "operationId": "createKlingImageGeneration4",
        "x-capability": "image_generation",
        "tags": [
          "Kling"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "application/json"
            },
            "description": "数据交换格式"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Kling4Request"
              },
              "examples": {
                "text_to_image": {
                  "summary": "文生单图",
                  "value": {
                    "model_name": "kling-4.0",
                    "contents": [
                      {
                        "type": "prompt",
                        "text": "生成一张三维动画风格的角色海报，暖色灯光，背景简洁。"
                      }
                    ],
                    "settings": {
                      "result_type": "single",
                      "n": 1,
                      "resolution": "2k",
                      "aspect_ratio": "1:1"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "image_to_series": {
                  "summary": "图生组图",
                  "value": {
                    "model_name": "kling-4.0",
                    "contents": [
                      {
                        "type": "prompt",
                        "text": "以 @dog 中的小狗为主角，生成四张连贯的三维动画风格故事图片，依次表现：走进咖啡馆、在窗边落座、闻咖啡香、在门口告别。保持小狗的毛色、外观和画面风格一致，每张图片对应一个情节。"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "refer_image",
                        "url": "https://p1-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-qa-test/dog.png",
                        "id": "dog"
                      }
                    ],
                    "settings": {
                      "result_type": "series",
                      "series_amount": 4,
                      "resolution": "2k",
                      "aspect_ratio": "3:4"
                    },
                    "options": {
                      "watermark_info": {
                        "enabled": false
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务已受理。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "response": {
                    "summary": "响应示例",
                    "value": {
                      "code": 0,
                      "message": "SUCCEED",
                      "request_id": "example-request-id",
                      "data": {
                        "id": "example-task-id",
                        "status": "submitted",
                        "create_time": 1790000000000,
                        "update_time": 1790000000000,
                        "external_id": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "在请求头中传入 `Authorization: Bearer <token>`。"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Kling4Content": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "prompt",
              "refer_image",
              "element"
            ],
            "description": "素材类型，支持：提示词、参考图、主体。\n\n枚举值：`prompt` / `refer_image` / `element`\n\n素材必须包含提示词，`prompt` 必填且非空。\n\n图片和主体合计最多 10 个，提示词不占参考名额。\n\n注意：主体（`element`）暂不对接，暂不支持传入。"
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "文本提示词，必填非空，可包含正向与负向描述。\n\n可将提示词模板化来满足不同的图像生成需求。\n\n提示词长度，纯英文不超过 50,000 字符，纯非英文不超过 21,000 字符；混合输入需满足：英文字符数/50000 + 非英文字符数/21000 ≤ 1。\n\n可通过 `@<id>` 引用参考图或主体。\n\n并通过 JSON 的格式定义，具体如下：\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"prompt\", \"text\": \"string\" }\n```",
            "x-valid-when": {
              "type": [
                "prompt"
              ]
            }
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "支持传入图片 URL 或 Base64 编码，URL 必须可访问，值不得为空。\n\n图片格式支持 .jpg / .jpeg / .png。\n\n单张图片文件不超过 30 MB，宽、高均不小于 300 px，宽高比为 2:5–5:2。\n\n并通过 JSON 的格式定义，具体如下：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"refer_image\",\n  \"url\": \"string\", // 参考图 URL 或 Base64 编码\n  \"id\": \"string\" // 素材索引 ID，用于在提示词中通过 @<id> 引用\n}\n```",
            "x-valid-when": {
              "type": [
                "refer_image"
              ]
            }
          },
          "element_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "主体 ID，由系统生成，可通过查询主体 API 获取，`type=element` 时必填。注意：主体暂不对接，该参数暂不支持传入。\n\n仅支持多图主体（通过图片定制的主体）。不同类型主体，适用范围不同，请注意区分。\n\n参考图片数量与主体数量之和不得超过 10。\n\n更多官方主体信息详见：[主体库](https://app.klingai.com/cn/dev/document-api/apiReference/model/customElements)。\n\n并通过 JSON 的格式定义，具体如下：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"element\",\n  \"element_id\": \"string\", // 主体 ID，通过查询主体 API 获取\n  \"id\": \"string\" // 素材索引 ID，用于在提示词中通过 @<id> 引用\n}\n```",
            "x-valid-when": {
              "type": [
                "element"
              ]
            }
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "素材索引ID，用于在 prompt 中指定，同任务中当前参数不得重复"
          }
        }
      },
      "Kling4Settings": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "输出配置相关参数，如清晰度、宽高比等。",
        "properties": {
          "result_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "single",
              "series"
            ],
            "default": "single",
            "description": "生成结果类型：单图/组图（枚举 `single` / `series`）。\n- `single`：为独立图片。可通过 `n` 生成多张；\n- `series`：为关联组图。组图模式下同组图片共享 `group_id`，按组内顺序返回"
          },
          "n": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 9,
            "default": 1,
            "description": "生成独立图片数量。单图模式选填；取值范围：[1,9]；当 `result_type=series` 时本参数无效，组图数量由 `series_amount` 指定。",
            "x-valid-when": {
              "result_type": [
                "single"
              ]
            }
          },
          "series_amount": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 2,
                "maximum": 10
              },
              {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "auto"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "default": 4,
            "description": "生成组图张数。类型：integer/string；组图模式选填；取值范围：[2,10] 或字符串 `auto`。`auto` 根据输入内容智能决定 2–10 张，占用与实际生成张数对应的并发量。仅 `result_type=series` 时生效。",
            "x-valid-when": {
              "result_type": [
                "series"
              ]
            }
          },
          "resolution": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "2k",
              "4k",
              "8k"
            ],
            "default": "2k",
            "description": "生成图片的清晰度。单图与组图均适用。\n- `2k`：2K 高清\n- `4k`：4K 高清\n- `8k`：8K 超清"
          },
          "aspect_ratio": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "16:9",
              "9:16",
              "1:1",
              "4:3",
              "3:4",
              "3:2",
              "2:3",
              "21:9",
              "auto"
            ],
            "default": "auto",
            "description": "生成图片的宽高比。`auto` 表示根据传入内容智能生成图片宽高比，单图与组图均适用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "Kling4Options": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "通用配置，如回调地址、是否含水印等。",
        "properties": {
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "本次任务结果回调通知地址。如果配置，服务端会在任务状态发生变更时主动通知。具体通知的消息 schema 见 [Callback 协议](https://app.klingai.com/cn/dev/document-api/api/get-started/callbacks)。"
          },
          "external_task_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "自定义任务ID。\n- 传入不会覆盖系统生成的任务ID，但支持通过该ID进行任务查询\n- 请注意，单用户下需要保证唯一性"
          },
          "watermark_info": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "是否同时生成含水印的结果。通过 `enabled` 参数定义，暂不支持自定义水印。\n\n```json\n\"watermark_info\": {\n  \"enabled\": false // 是否生成含水印结果，true 为生成，false 为不生成；默认为 false\n}\n```",
            "properties": {
              "enabled": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": false,
                "description": "true 为生成，false 为不生成，默认 false。"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Kling4Request": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model_name",
          "contents"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "kling-4.0"
            ],
            "description": "模型名称",
            "example": "kling-4.0"
          },
          "contents": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "参考素材合集，如：提示词、图片、主体。\n\n参考格式如下，参数说明详见下文：\n\n```json\n\"contents\": [\n  {\n    \"type\": \"prompt\",\n    \"text\": \"string\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"refer_image\",\n    \"url\": \"string\",\n    \"id\": \"string\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"element\",\n    \"element_id\": \"string\",\n    \"id\": \"string\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n- 提示词、参考图、主体的排列顺序即为分析顺序\n\n注意：主体（`element`）暂不对接，暂不支持传入。",
            "minItems": 1,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Kling4Content"
            }
          },
          "settings": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Kling4Settings"
          },
          "options": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Kling4Options"
          }
        }
      },
      "SubmitResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "错误码；0 为成功，具体定义见错误码文档。",
            "example": 0
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "接口消息。",
            "example": "SUCCEED"
          },
          "request_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "请求跟踪 ID，由系统生成，用于跟踪请求、排查问题。",
            "example": "example-request-id"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "系统任务 ID，由平台生成。",
                "example": "example-task-id"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "submitted",
                  "processing",
                  "succeeded",
                  "failed"
                ],
                "description": "任务状态：submitted（已提交）、processing（处理中）、succeeded（成功）、failed（失败）。",
                "example": "submitted"
              },
              "create_time": {
                "type": "integer",
                "format": "int64",
                "description": "任务创建时间，Unix 毫秒时间戳。",
                "example": 1790000000000
              },
              "update_time": {
                "type": "integer",
                "format": "int64",
                "description": "任务更新时间，Unix 毫秒时间戳。",
                "example": 1790000000000
              },
              "external_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "创建时指定的自定义任务 ID（如有）。",
                "example": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
